OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle registration scheme for
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople using a household waste and
OL,7,Frecycling centre (HWRC) will have to
OL,8,Fregister their vehicle's number plate
OL,9,Fonline from 1 October.
OL,11,FBedford Borough council says it's
OL,12,Freplacing the permit system at Barkers
OL,13,FLane to protect it from people using it
OL,14,Ffrom outside the area.
OL,16,FThe authority says neighbouring
OL,17,Fcouncils operating stronger controls at
OL,18,Ftheir HWRCs have led to a "significant
OL,19,Fincrease" in tonnage at that tip.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
