OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle registration scheme for
OL,4,Arecycling centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndependent councillor Nicky Gribble,
OL,7,FPortfolio Holder for Environment, said:
OL,8,F"It's unfair to residents and
OL,9,Fresponsible businesses if household
OL,10,Ffacilities are used to avoid commercial
OL,11,Fwaste costs. This system will reduce
OL,12,Finappropriate waste, save money and
OL,13,Fimprove access for residents."
